    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35565" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθεμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thing put in, graft,</i>
